title: "Scandium: Precision Landing and GNSS-Denied Navigation System for UAVs"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
url: "https://github.com/emrealtindag/scandium"
repository-code: "https://github.com/emrealtindag/scandium"
keywords:
  - UAV
  - Precision Landing
  - Sensor Fusion
  - Extended Kalman Filter
  - Computer Vision
  - PX4
  - ArduPilot
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  Scandium is a production-grade precision landing system designed for UAV and multirotor platforms. 
  It provides GNSS-denied navigation, optical flow odometry, and deep learning-based landability assessment
  integrated tightly with MAVLink autopilot systems.
